{"slug":"KJ-The-Strongest-Battlegrounds-Kyra-Kj-26175","_id":"677c7eb5ccd3613d4acb1507","title":"Kyra Kj","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d29","gameId":10449761463,"name":"The Strongest Battlegrounds","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":10449761463},"features":"Kyra Kj but this is actually the kyra loadstring that has settings that isnt from golden head\nsolara isnt support \nand also you will see some black thing called \"BOB\" dont worry he's chill dont get too close tho\nall credit's are to Kyra","tags":[],"script":"--SETTINGS\n_G.TpDash = false --tp dashes\n_G.WallComboFrames = true\n_G.WallCutscene = true --cutscene for wallcombo\n_G.KJAnims = false --Plays real kj anims while others still see the FE anims\n_G.ImpactTransparency = 0 --if u wanna see the world while seeing the frames then set it to 0.3 or smth\n_G.MoreSFX = true -- unused rn --(Recommended if you want more spicier sfx than just official tsb sfx for kj)\n_G.InfiniteKJ = false --(dont use for now, it breaks the script after death aka with num4 or num3) (to disable after use, choose another character)\n_G.CustomBlock = false\n_G.nostunoption = false\n_G.captions = true\n_G.nodashcooldown = true --removes dash cooldown (ONLY WORKS ON PRIVATE SERVERS)\n_G.FightMusic = true --turns ur mindset into the main character (plays under 75% health)\n_G.DashTech = false --might break dash for some users, but allows you to use dash tech\n\n--[[ NOTES:\n- ULT IS UNFINISHED\n- Get Ultimate 1 by standing still, get Ultimate 2 by walking while Ulting\n- Critical Blow will change depending if u use Barrage before it\n- Ravage does 46.5% Damage\n- Use Variants of 1 or 2 by holding jump button\n- Five Seasons Auto Aims towards the nearest target at a range of 1500 studs (they cant escape)\n- Five Seasons might break for some users that dont have good pcs\n- VARIANTS RELY ON GOOD PING\n\nTIPS:\n- Stoic Bomb's Range is further on the front by a little\n- Dropkick's Run goes faster in air, but is harder to aim\n- Using death counter wont give ur base movesets names back, which breaks the script,\nwhich also allows you to keep no stun on, but sacrifices the ability to use Variants\n- To do the M1 tech, u gotta sidedash, m1, and jump, at the same time\n- Downslam + Critical Blow Variant acts the same way as Deadly Ninja's Whirlwind Kick,\nwhich basically means that if u use Downslam and then use Critical Blow right when they get up,\nit will make then downslammed again (big combo extender)\n]]\n\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fartmaggot445/KYR/refs/heads/main/kj\"))()","owner":{"_id":"67692e77b3732fdcea476ae4","username":"csenkeyc","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"67692e77b3732fdcea476ae4","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"verified":false,"keyLink":"","views":65600,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2025-01-07T01:09:09.385Z","dislikeCount":3,"likeCount":47,"image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a13fa7fa734f7c261477edfc15ef3271/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a13fa7fa734f7c261477edfc15ef3271/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter"},"executes":2806,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-14T04:17:41.361Z"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a13fa7fa734f7c261477edfc15ef3271/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a13fa7fa734f